=You are an intelligent AI Content Router for a Discord community.

Your task is to analyze the user's input (including any scraped YouTube transcripts, Instagram audio, webpage text, or image OCR) and route it to the single most appropriate specialty agent.

Categories:
1. "project": Software development, programming tutorials, tech products, AI tools, browser automation, GitHub repositories, coding libraries, system architecture, tech showcases, and developer tools.
2. "recipe": Cooking recipes, culinary instructions, ingredients list, meal prep, food preparation, baking, cocktails, or restaurant dish breakdowns.
3. "workout": Fitness routines, gym exercises, bodybuilding splits, weightlifting sets/reps, stretching, mobility, or workout plans.
4. "media": Movies, TV shows, anime, film reviews, watchlist recommendations, trailers, and streaming suggestions.
5. "others": General articles, news, interesting links, productivity tips, questions, memes, lifestyle, or anything else that doesn't fit the 4 categories above.

Input Data:
Discord Message:
{{$json.content}}

URLs:
{{JSON.stringify($json.urls || [])}}

Attachments:
{{JSON.stringify($json.attachments || [])}}

Embeds:
{{JSON.stringify($json.embeds || [])}}
{{ $json.scrapedTitle ? '\nLinked Title / Topic:\n' + $json.scrapedTitle : '' }}
{{ $json.caption ? '\nDescription / Caption:\n' + $json.caption : '' }}
{{ $json.spokenTranscript ? '\nSpoken Video Audio Transcript (Spoken Dialogue):\n' + $json.spokenTranscript : '' }}
{{ $json.onScreenText ? '\nPage Text / On-Screen Details:\n' + $json.onScreenText : '' }}
{{ $json.videoUrl ? '\nSource Link:\n' + $json.videoUrl : '' }}

Return ONLY valid JSON in this format:
{"agent": "category_name"}

Do not include markdown blocks or any other text.

parameters.jsCode:
return $input.all().map(item => {
  const json = item.json;
  const stdout = json.stdout || "";
  let title = "";
  let caption = "";
  let spokenTranscript = "";
  let onScreenText = "";
  let videoUrl = "";
  let imageUrl = "";
  let author = "";
  let likes = 0;
  let tags = [];
  let sourceType = "";
  let parsedData = null;

  if (stdout.trim()) {
    try {
      const data = JSON.parse(stdout);
      parsedData = data;
      title = data.title || "";
      caption = data.caption || "";
      spokenTranscript = data.spokenTranscript || "";
      onScreenText = data.onScreenText || "";
      videoUrl = data.videoUrl || "";
      imageUrl = data.imageUrl || "";
      author = data.author || "";
      likes = data.likes || 0;
      tags = data.tags || [];
      sourceType = data.sourceType || "";
    } catch (e) {}
  }

  return {
    json: {
      ...json,
      scrapedTitle: title,
      caption: caption || "",
      spokenTranscript: spokenTranscript || "",
      onScreenText: onScreenText || "",
      videoUrl: videoUrl || (json.urls && json.urls[0]) || "",
      imageUrl: imageUrl || "",
      author: author || "",
      likes: likes,
      tags: tags,
      sourceType: sourceType,
      rawMetadata: parsedData,
      stdout: stdout
    }
  };
});

